WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
Cammy guards Ryu’s OD Shoryuken and waits for recovery.

2
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.650
Crouching heavy punch begins the Punish Counter juggle.

3
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.850
Back heavy kick lifts Ryu for the light-Knuckle continuation.

4
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:07.050
Cammy cancels the light Knuckle into Level 1.

5
00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.300
Level 1 finishes its final kicking sequence.
